This repository builds on data from AgentHallu:

  Liu, X., Yang, X., Li, Z., Li, P., & He, R. (2026). AgentHallu: Benchmarking
  automated hallucination attribution of LLM-based agents. EMNLP 2026.
  https://github.com/liuxuannan/AgentHallu (commit 9ffe8bc)

The AgentHallu repository states CC BY 4.0; the paper states CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
We follow the stricter terms: attribution, non-commercial use, share-alike.
Files in this repository that contain AgentHallu trace text (results/step_table.csv,
app/data/items.js) are derived from that dataset and are shared under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
The datasets themselves are not redistributed here; download them from their sources.
